                        "description": "",
                        "params": {
                            "fontSize": 12,
                            "markdown": "#### GitHub\n\n**Organization Teams**\n\nThis dashboard gives visibility into the GitHub organization teams data stream. It highlights how many distinct teams were observed, how that count changes over time, and how teams split by privacy. It surfaces child teams grouped by parent team and when teams were created. Counts use the team entity id, so a daily collection does not count the same team more than once. Use the controls above to filter by privacy and parent team. Together, these panels offer a roster view to support access review and organization inventory.\n\n**[Integration Page](/app/integrations/detail/github/overview)**\n",
                            "openLinksInNewTab": false
                        },
